<title>USA: GRC names CEO Roth as chairman.</title>
<headline>GRC names CEO Roth as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRC International said on Tuesday it named President and Chief Executive Jim Roth to the additional post of chairman, effective November 7.</p>
<p>The company also said it expanded its board to 11 directors, naming Frank Cilluffo to the newly created seat. Cilluffo is a general partner of the company's largest shareholder, Cilluffo Associates LP.</p>
<p>Edward Meyer would remain chairman of the board until the transition, the company said. He would also remain an outside director of the company.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
